## 5. NAMING CONVENTIONS

- Files: kebab-case for all files (`post-card.tsx`, `use-wellness.ts`)
- Components: PascalCase exports (`PostCard`, `WellnessNudge`)
- Hooks: camelCase with `use` prefix (`useWellness`, `useFeed`)
- Database tables: snake_case plural (`wellness_events`, `personality_profiles`)
- API routes: kebab-case paths (`/api/ai/post-companion`)
- Environment variables: SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE with `SERENE_` prefix
  - Browser-accessible vars (Next.js requires `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix for client reads):
    - `NEXT_PUBLIC_SERENE_SUPABASE_URL`
    - `NEXT_PUBLIC_SERENE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
  - Server-only vars (never expose to client):
    - `SERENE_SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY`
    - `SERENE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`
    - `SERENE_R2_BUCKET_URL`
    - `SERENE_R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID`
    - `SERENE_R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`
    - `SERENE_CLOUDFLARE_STREAM_TOKEN`
    - `SERENE_CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`

